1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,500
I teach technology
in the Dominican Republic.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:12,000
A submitted assignment
no longer proves learning.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Muse drafts assignments
and competencies.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:27,000
I review them and choose
how much help students receive.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:35,000
I also choose where they submit,
including Classroom.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:41,000
The agent analyzes difficulty,
time and priority.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,000
It organizes the week.

8
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Camila sees what comes next
and why.

9
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
One tap starts a voice conversation
with her companion.

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:07,000
When she pauses,
the tutor responds with a question.

11
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:15,000
That question helps her think.

12
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:21,000
She submits the assignment
in Classroom.

13
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Here she provides evidence
and confirms her submission.

14
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Then she explains her work.

15
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Submission and understanding
are different.

16
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:47,000
In this equations example,
she explains each operation.

17
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Why does she take each step?

18
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:00,000
How does she check the result?

19
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:05,000
She gets a level per concept.

20
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:10,000
The report includes evidence
from her explanation.

21
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:15,000
A short practice path
targets what she needs to improve.

22
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:21,000
I compare submission
with demonstrated understanding.

23
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Here, one hundred
versus forty-two percent.

24
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:35,000
I move from the class overview
to each student's needs.

25
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Muse drafts feedback from
the submission and explanation.

26
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:48,000
I review it and send it.

27
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:51,500
Muse Spark, Muse Voice Transcribe
and Muse Spark Open.

28
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:55,000
Submission is not learning.
Show what you learned.
